92
00:03:16,496 --> 00:03:19,004
The candidates are a half, two and four.

93
00:03:19,989 --> 00:03:21,716
Now evaluate f at each one.

94
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:24,844
f of a half is a half plus

95
00:03:24,926 --> 00:03:26,509
