100
00:03:34,936 --> 00:03:35,385
Compare them.

101
00:03:35,988 --> 00:03:38,594
The global minimum is four, at the stationary

102
00:03:38,635 --> 00:03:40,138
point x equals two.

103
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:43,164
The global maximum is eight and a half,

104
00:03:43,505 --> 00:03:46,069
at the endpoint x equals a half, where

105
00:03:46,090 --> 00:03:47,512
the tangent isn't flat at all.

106
00:03:48,174 --> 00:03:50,922
Solving f prime equals zero alone would have

107
00:03:51,003 --> 00:03:51,804
